{"unit_id":"863683348__dsh-plugin-finance-data#feature-3","repo":"863683348/dsh-plugin-finance-data","commit":"0a10267fa6f8f75da68005406b899894b60dd796","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-finance-data 的「风险分析」功能：从收益率序列计算均值、样本波动率、最大回撤、历史 VaR(95) 和夏普比率。调用 risk 动作并提供至少两个收益率，可选输入无风险利率，工具返回指标摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:152-162","lib/finance.js:91-113"]}
